<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Ssangyong Paper '96 net rises.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Ssangyong Paper '96 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)			1,056     vs	 716</p>
<p>    Net				    4.76  vs	   3.06</p>
<p>    Pre-tax net			  6.57  vs	   4.55</p>
<p>    Turnover			   300.32  vs	 266.68</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, in cash, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>			 common	   10.0   vs    10.0</p>
<p>			 preferred	10.0   vs    10.0</p>
<p>    Extraordinary gain		 0.29  vs     0.28</p>
<p>Note - Ssangyong Paper Co Ltd, an affilate of the Ssangyong Group, said its 1996 share capital was unchanged at 4.83 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
